</head>
<body>
  <div id="comment-board">
    <h2>Comment Board</h2>
    <input type="text" id="comment-input" placeholder="Enter a comment..." disabled>
    <button type="submit">Post Comment</button>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Comment</th>
          <th>Upvotes</th>
          <th>Downvotes</th>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <!-- Comments will be inserted here -->
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
```

This system allows users to enter a comment, click the "Post Comment" button to submit the comment, and view the results in the comment board with upvote and downvote counters. You can further customize this system to fit your specific needs, such as adding more columns for other information or implementing a user authentication system to prevent spam comments.

